    "question": "Identify the parts of speech of each underlined word (10×1=10):\n(a) The __music__ playing in the next room prevented her from sleeping.\n(b) I was at a __nearby__ park when the building collapsed.\n(c) He was given a set of data for __analysis__.\n(d) __Someone__ donated a huge sum of money to the children’s home.\n(e) She has completed the job __already__.\n(f) __Ouch!__ Stop poking me. That hurts.\n(g) Historians __disagree__ about exactly when the decline of the British empire began.\n(h) The movie was filled with __meaningless__ violence.\n(i) __Underneath__ the huge tree, a treasure was hidden.\n(j) I arrived at the airport two hours early; __however__, my flight was delayed.",
