    "explanation": "A strong response uses a formal letter layout, identifies the locality and frequency/timing of outages, explains practical effects (lighting, study, work, appliances or essential services), requests inspection and reliable restoration, and closes politely. Sign as “Engliana”; avoid inventing unsupported details.",
    "sourceReview": false,
