    "topic": "written",
    "topicLabel": "General English · written",
    "difficulty": "medium",
    "question": "During the past year there were several cases of death in your village due to the absence of qualified doctors in the Primary Health Centre. There was also an outbreak of cholera and the medical personnel were insufficient to cope with the crisis. Write a letter to the Minister, Health and Family Welfare Department, requesting for at least two qualified doctors to be posted in your village. Sign yourself as ABC of XXX, YZ District(10)",
