    "question": "Fill in the blanks with the appropriate word/ words:(10×1=10) (i)The lion sprang __________ the buffaloes.\na. at\nb. in\nc. upon\nd. on (a)with(b)to (c)at(d)in (a)in(b)have (c)having(d)with (a)through(b)at (c)over(d)by need for change. (a)expressive(b)articulate (c)eloquent(d)calm (a)with(b)by (c)to(d)upon (a)with(b)in (c)into(d)on (a)of(b)about (c)for(d)inside (a)correct(b)fitting (c)appropriate(d)useful second days. (a)displayed(b)exposed (c)view(d)showed",
