    "question": "Translate the following paragraph from Mizo to English.(6) Mi chungchanga ngaih dân kan siam hian hmuh hmaih kan nei châwk. Chu chu ‘tumna a awm chuan kawng a awm,’ tih hi a ni. Ka hmêl hriat, pa pakhat chuan tumah hneh a nei lo va; mahse, insuala nguiban thei an awm miah lo thung. He pa hi a luhlul a, a huai a, a chhel êm êm a, engahmah hian tlawm a tum ngai lo. A tâwpa tâwpah chuan a aia chakte pawhin an ngam peih tawh lo mai \\hin. Rilru chhungrila tumruhna inphûm te, rualawhna te, taihmâkna te, chhelna te, hlawhchham tum lohna awm te hi kan inhmuhpui zo vek sêng ngai lo. Khaw khat nula hmêl\\ha leh fel neitu chu mi hmêl\\ha ber leh hausa ber an ni chuang lo. ‘Saw pa nupui atan saw chuan ka va ui e,’ i tih chuan, saw pa saw i hre chiang lo a ni. A nupuiin amaha thil hlu inphûm a hmuh i hmu ve lo tlat alawm!",
