    "question": "Read the following passage carefully and answer the questions that follow : India has come a long way in the development of educational infrastructure since independence. However, the demand for quality education based on the latest research, outstrips the supply, especially so in the fields of engineering, medicine, management, economics, applied sciences and mass communication. No wonder then, that a number of young people are looking outside the country for education. Further, there is a prestige value associated with scholarships, more so because it is a hard competition to bag one. Foreign scholarships in particular give the students an opportunity to interact with international teaching and student community. It ensures exposure not only to a different educational system but also to modern up-to-date facilities, which complement the quality of education offered. While most foreign universities normally expect overseas students to have good scores in the qualifying examinations such as the GMAT, GRE, SAT and TOEFL, in the case of certain professional courses like journalism and photography, work experience is a must for an entry to their advanced courses. Academic and research-oriented studies are naturally the focal points, but professional courses also figure in the scholarships given by the universities. Even in the academics the sky is the limit. Name the subject and scholarships are available in each one of them. Scholarships in relatively new subjects such as, Naval Architecture, Micro electronics, Geotechnical Engineering, Fibre- optics and Laser technology have become one of the most coveted ones. One thing of seminal importance is the choice of subject. It is not important whether you get umpteen degrees and file them away or you go to the choices university. There are various tests like aptitude test that some universities abroad conduct to judge your knowledge. At the end of the test , you are sure about what you want to study and whether you are suited for it. A good number of career consultants are available and they can guide one in the right directions. Apart from personal",
